# Crew Environment Variables
# Copy to .crew/.env and fill in your values
# This file is sourced before each agent starts
#
# Naming convention: {PROVIDER}_{PROTOCOL}_{FIELD}
# Protocols:
#   _ANT_ = Anthropic-compatible (for claude CLI)
#   _OAI_ = OpenAI-compatible (for codex CLI)

# ==============================================
# 1. CLAUDE CLI (Anthropic Compatible / _ANT_)
#    Requires: ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL, ANTHROPIC_MODEL, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
# ==============================================

# Anthropic (Default)
# 1ST_ANT_URL=https://api.anthropic.com
# 1ST_ANT_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-20250514
# 1ST_ANT_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Example 3rd Party (DeepSeek, OpenRouter, etc.)
# DEEPSEEK_ANT_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
# DEEPSEEK_ANT_MODEL=deepseek-coder
# DEEPSEEK_ANT_KEY=...

# TOGETHER_ANT_URL=https://api.together.xyz/v1
# TOGETHER_ANT_MODEL=meta-llama/Llama-3-70b-chat-hf
# TOGETHER_ANT_KEY=...

# ==============================================
# 2. CODEX CLI (OpenAI Compatible / _OAI_)
#    Requires: CODEX_BASE_URL, CODEX_MODEL, OPENAI_API_KEY
# ==============================================

# OpenAI (Default)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=o3-mini

# Example 3rd Party (DashScope, MiniMax, etc.)
# QW_OAI_URL=https://coding.dashscope.aliyuncs.com/v1
# QW_OAI_MODEL=qwen3.5-plus
# QW_OAI_KEY=sk-sp-...

# ==============================================
# 3. LOCAL LLM (Ollama, LMStudio, llama.cpp)
# ==============================================
# LOCAL_OAI_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# LOCAL_OAI_MODEL=llama3
# LOCAL_OAI_KEY=ollama

# ==============================================
# 4. OPENCODE CLI & GEMINI CLI
# ==============================================
# OPENCODE_MODEL=zen/big-pickle
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...

# ── Model Configuration ──
# These can be overridden per-agent via crew.yaml `env` field.
# When using fallback, each level overrides these values.

# ── Fallback Order ──
# Configure in crew.yaml per-agent `fallback` array.
# Each level is tried in order when the previous level exhausts max_restarts.
# Fallback levels can also switch CLI types (e.g., claude -> codex).
#
# See crew.yaml for full configuration.
